    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tower defense lets you shape the entire landscape and take full control of the level. Use the terrain to your advantage to slow down the enemies. Have fun building your walls and castle defenses to fight off waves of cat burglars and other furry creatures as you protect your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of upgrades to invest in to strengthen your defense and help you protect the town hall like traps, turrets, and resource buildings.</p>",
